$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add Checking --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add leumi --kind bank --currency ILS --opening 1000 --date 2026-10-01
Added account leumi (ILS).

$ moolah add leumi -50 food --date 2026-10-02 --payee Cafe --tag trip
Added transaction 2 on 2026-10-02 (Cafe):
  assets:bank:leumi              -50.00 ILS
  expenses:food                  50.00 ILS

$ moolah category rename food eat
Renamed food to eat.

$ moolah rule add cafe eat
Added rule 1.

$ moolah config set locale de_DE
Set locale.

$ moolah delete 2 --yes
Deleted transaction 2.

